# APT Sources Configuration for SoryOS Repository # This file should be added to /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ or similar to enable the SoryOS APT repository. # # For binary packages: deb [trusted=yes] https://sory-x.github.io/soryos-apt/ ./ # For source packages: deb-src [trusted=yes] https://sory-x.github.io/soryos-apt/ ./ # # Note: In a production setting, you should replace [trusted=yes] with proper GPG verification. # For now, during development, we use trusted=yes to avoid GPG errors. # # To add this repository temporarily for testing: #   sudo sh -c 'echo 